  "historyNote": "#2055, eff 6-16-82; ss by #2714, eff 5-16-84; ss by #4851, eff 6-25-90; EXPIRED 6-25-96 New. #6366, eff 10-30-96, EXPIRED: 10-30-96 New. #8265, eff 1-22-05; ss by #9638, eff 1-20-10",
